  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "塩味と　苦味が　強い　食材。サンドウィッチに　するならば酸味がある　味つけが　よい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "짠맛과 쓴맛이 강한 식재료. 샌드위치에 넣을 거라면 신맛을 첨가하는 것이 좋다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "鹹味和苦味強勁的食材。若要用於三明治，建議佐以酸味。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très salé et amer. Dans un Sandwich, il s’accorde mieux avec des aliments aux saveurs plus acides.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Verwendet man sie als Sandwichbelag, sollte man diese sehr salzige sowie bittere Zutat am besten säuerlich würzen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente con un fuerte toque salado y amargo que combina especialmente bien con condimentos ácidos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto salato e amaro. Nei panini è ottimo accompagnato da un condimento aspro.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "When used in a sandwich, this very salty and bitter ingredient is at its best paired with sour seasonings.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "塩味と　苦味が　強い　食材。サンドウィッチに　するならば酸味がある　味つけが　よい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "咸味和苦味强烈的食材。若要用来制作三明治，调味时最好加入酸味。",
